	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div>
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S. D.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">Scribae vestri filius fuisset mihi gratus <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>hospes; recordor enim adhuc humanitatis et hospi<lb xml:id="p1z3"/>talitatis paternae mihi quondam exhibitae.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Sed <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>nunquam vel hac adhuc hora ad me venit; nunquam ipsum <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>vidi, nec ipse mihi reddidit literas tuas.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Hodie <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>audio illum heri peracta coena lusisse inter Ly<lb xml:id="p1z7"/>ciscanos; audio illum hospitari apud <persName ref="p3924">Wellenbergium</persName>; <lb xml:id="p1z8"/>habet ergo, qui ipsum pro dignitate tractent, ut mea <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non indigeat opera.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Alioqui paratus sum patri <lb xml:id="p1z10"/>et omnibus eius inservire.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z11"/>Scripsit eadem mihi ex <placeName ref="l830">Anglia</placeName> D. <persName>Bernardinus</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>quae tibi nunciavit charissimus frater D. <persName ref="p8041">Ioannes a Lasco</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>pulchre videlicet procedere religionis reformationem, <lb xml:id="p1z14"/>deo gratia.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Nosti procul dubio 16. Ianuarii sub <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>mediam noctem regem prope interceptum fuisse <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>parricidio; admiralis enim, frater protectoris, vit<lb xml:id="p1z17"/>ae regis insidias struxerat.</s>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Verum servatus <lb xml:id="p1z18"/>ext rex divina benignitate et protectione.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Latro <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>coniectus est in vincula ac dedit iamdudum haud <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>dubie poenas scelere dignas.</s>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la">Sic scribunt ad me <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>viri boni.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z22"/>Caesar valde ineptit, si putat tantum in <placeName ref="l822">Germania</placeName> <lb xml:id="p1z23"/>superesse viros 4, qui se opponant suo Interim.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p1z24"/><persName ref="p540">Calvino</persName> recte iudicat; meretur hic laudem aeternam, <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>quod se erroribus nephariis et impietati obiecit.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la">De <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>aliis nihil possum dicere vel iudicare, qui nihil <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>viderim contra Interim aeditum.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la">Sed nescit Caesar, <lb xml:id="p1z28"/>quod in evangelio ait dominus: "Si hi tacuerint, lapides <lb xml:id="p1z29"/>clamabunt," et quod hodie quoque vera est sententia et manebit <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>in finem usque: "Reliqui mihi adhuc 7000 virorum, qui <lb xml:id="p1z31"/>genua sua non curvarunt Interim, dicere vo<lb xml:id="p1z33"/>lebam Baal, vel Jerobeamo."</s>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la">De mathematicorum <lb xml:id="p1z34"/>iudicio parum sum solicitus; falluntur semper.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la">Scio <lb xml:id="p1z35"/>autem vivere in coelis, qui hanc hydram conficiet.</s>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z36"/>Quae de <placeName ref="l257">Constantien[sibus]</placeName> scripta misi <placeName ref="l28">Basileam</placeName>, propter <lb xml:id="p1z37"/>te misi per <persName>Gasparem Mesikomerum</persName>.</s>
					<s n="18" xml:lang="la">Miror si hic <lb xml:id="p1z38"/>nostram fefellit fidem, cum alioqui sit fidelis.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="19" xml:lang="de">Summa: <lb xml:id="p1z39"/>Die <placeName ref="l257">Constantzer</placeName> sind umb zünfft, der zünfften <lb xml:id="p1z40"/>guͤter, umb den glouben und umb alles mittein<lb xml:id="p1z41"/>andren kummen; sy muͤssind erbliche <placeName ref="l850">Oesterryc<lb xml:id="p1z42"/>her</placeName> sin und das bapsthumb glatt widerumb annemmen.</s>
					<s n="20" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p1z43"/>Da soll nieman wychen, biß alle klagen abtragen.</s>
					<s n="21" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z44"/>Vale.</s>
					<s n="22" xml:lang="la">Habes hic Decades sermonum II; eae in caussa fuerunt, quominus <lb xml:id="p1z45"/>frequentes ad te dederim hactenus.</s>
					<s n="23" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z46"/>7. <lb xml:id="p1z47"/>Martii anno 1549.</s>
					<s n="24" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salutant te fratres omnes<lb xml:id="p1z48"/>.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="25" xml:lang="de"><pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>Es hatt mir ein guͦter xell das vatter unser gäben, das ich üch <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>da abschryb; sol, alls er sagt, zuͦ <placeName ref="l257">Constantz</placeName> gemachet sin, frylich <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>von den keyserischen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="26" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z4"/>Truw <lb xml:id="p2z5"/>gott, sy werdent mitt <lb xml:id="p2z6"/>dem gottslestern wenig gewinnen: Vatter unser, <placeName ref="l335">Mil<lb xml:id="p2z7"/>husen</placeName> ist unser; der du bist, <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> ouch unser ist; imm hymmel, <lb xml:id="p2z8"/>vor <placeName ref="l441">Schaffhusen</placeName> sol uns glingen.</s>
					<s n="27" xml:lang="de">Geheiligt werd din namm, <lb xml:id="p2z9"/><placeName ref="l587">Zürych</placeName> muͦß ouch dran.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="28" xml:lang="de">Zukomm uns din rych, <placeName ref="l41">Bernn</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z11"/>und all sin glich.</s>
					<s n="29" xml:lang="de">Din will der geschäch, wir sind noch <lb xml:id="p2z12"/>nitt gräch; uff erden, <placeName ref="l2450">Schwytz</placeName> sol uns ouch werden, wie inn <lb xml:id="p2z13"/>hymel, es thuͦt anschlag glingen, das wir <placeName ref="l98">Chur</placeName> <lb xml:id="p2z14"/>und ander <placeName ref="l862">Eydgnossen</placeName>, die kleinen und die groossen, on <lb xml:id="p2z15"/>schwärtschlag mitt myet und gaben umbstoossen.</s>
					<s n="30" xml:lang="de"><lb xml:id="p2z16"/>Vide, <lb xml:id="p2z17"/>was lusiger, lamer zotten aber das sind.</s>
					<s n="31" xml:lang="de">Man sölte wol die ellenden rymen <lb xml:id="p2z18"/>also beschliessen: Deß soll man uns bes<lb xml:id="p2z19"/>temppete possen <lb xml:id="p2z20"/>an ein alte hächle<lb xml:id="p2z21"/>n arßbossen.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse:]</note>
					<s n="32" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p2z22"/>Praestantiss<lb xml:id="p2z23"/>imo viro D. <persName ref="p8418">Osvaldo Myconio</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z24"/><placeName ref="l28">Basiliensis</placeName> ecclesiae fideli ministro, fratri charissi<lb xml:id="p2z25"/>mo suo.</s>
					<s n="33" xml:lang="de"><placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
